config-connector-extensions patch 0042: mockgcp serves per-instance configs of zonal managed instance groups.

mockgcp served createInstances, listPerInstanceConfigs,
updatePerInstanceConfigs, deletePerInstanceConfigs,
applyUpdatesToInstances and listManagedInstances for regional groups
only (instancegroupmanager.go); a zonal group answered Unimplemented.
This adds them for zonal groups in a new file, as the regional ones do
it, for ComputePerInstanceConfig. A zonal group has no instance
redistribution, so createInstances takes no such check.

diff --git a/mockgcp/mockcompute/zonalperinstanceconfigs.go b/mockgcp/mockcompute/zonalperinstanceconfigs.go
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..44822114
--- /dev/null
+++ b/mockgcp/mockcompute/zonalperinstanceconfigs.go
@@ -0,0 +1,161 @@
